# Hospital CMMS - Project Recovery Guide

Panduan untuk mengatasi masalah project seperti:

- UI tidak berubah walaupun file sudah diedit
- Project menjalankan folder lama
- Git branch tidak sinkron
- Merge conflict
- Dependency error setelah pindah device
- Ingin mengambil versi terbaru GitHub dengan kondisi bersih

---

# 1. Backup Project Lama

Sebelum melakukan recovery, jangan langsung hapus project lama.

Buat backup:

```
hospital-cmms
```

menjadi:

```
hospital-cmms-backup
```

atau compress:

```
hospital-cmms-backup.zip
```

Backup yang perlu disimpan:

```
.env
database (jika diperlukan)
source code
storage upload (jika ada)
```

---

# 2. Jangan Backup Folder Ini

Folder berikut tidak perlu disimpan:

```
node_modules/
vendor/
.vite/
storage/framework/views/
```

Alasan:

| Folder | Fungsi |
|---|---|
| node_modules | Dependency frontend |
| vendor | Dependency Laravel Composer |
| .vite | Cache Vite |
| storage/framework/views | Compiled Blade cache |

Folder tersebut akan dibuat ulang.

---

# 3. Rename / Bersihkan Project Lama

Contoh:

```bash
mv hospital-cmms hospital-cmms-backup
```

atau hapus setelah yakin:

```bash
rm -rf hospital-cmms
```

---

# 4. Clone Ulang dari GitHub

Masuk folder developer:

```bash
cd ~/developer
```

Clone branch yang dibutuhkan:

```bash
git clone -b nama-branch https://github.com/Naverestaroth/hospital-cmms.git hospital-cmms
```

Contoh:

```bash
git clone -b feature/asset-qr https://github.com/Naverestaroth/hospital-cmms.git hospital-cmms
```

---

# 5. Masuk Project Baru

```bash
cd hospital-cmms
```

Cek lokasi:

```bash
pwd
```

Pastikan folder yang aktif adalah:

```
/Users/username/developer/hospital-cmms
```

---

# 6. Verifikasi Git

Cek branch:

```bash
git branch
```

Contoh:

```
* feature/asset-qr
  main
```

Cek commit:

```bash
git log --oneline -5
```

Pastikan commit sesuai dengan versi yang diinginkan.

---

# 7. Restore Environment

Copy `.env` dari backup:

```bash
cp ../hospital-cmms-backup/.env .env
```

Generate key jika diperlukan:

```bash
php artisan key:generate
```

---

# 8. Install Dependency

## Laravel

```bash
composer install
```

## Frontend

```bash
npm install
```

---

# 9. Clear Cache Laravel

Selalu lakukan setelah pindah project:

```bash
php artisan optimize:clear
```

Jika Blade masih menggunakan tampilan lama:

```bash
rm -rf storage/framework/views/*
```

---

# 10. Jalankan Project

## Laravel Server

### Menggunakan Artisan:

```bash
php artisan serve
```

Akses:

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

---

### Menggunakan Laravel Herd:

Tidak perlu:

```bash
php artisan serve
```

Cukup:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Akses:

```
http://hospital-cmms.test
```

---

# 11. Jalankan Vite

```bash
npm run dev
```

Jika Vite bermasalah:

```bash
rm -rf node_modules
rm -rf .vite
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

# 12. Troubleshooting UI Tidak Berubah

Jika file sudah berbeda tetapi tampilan masih lama:

## 1. Cek folder aktif

```bash
pwd
```

Pastikan bukan folder backup.

---

## 2. Cek server yang berjalan

Matikan server lama:

```bash
pkill -f artisan
```

Kemudian jalankan ulang.

---

## 3. Clear Laravel Cache

```bash
php artisan optimize:clear
```

---

## 4. Cek Blade yang digunakan

Cek controller:

```bash
grep -n "return view" app/Http/Controllers/NamaController.php
```

Pastikan file Blade yang diedit adalah file yang dirender.

---

## 5. Pastikan Tidak Menjalankan Project Lama

Jika project backup dihapus tetapi website masih berjalan:

Kemungkinan server masih menunjuk folder lama.

Restart:

- Artisan server
- Laravel Herd
- Browser

---

# 13. Workflow Git Collaboration

Hindari:

```
Download ZIP
↓
Edit
↓
Push
```

Gunakan:

```
Clone Repository
        |
        ↓
Create Branch
        |
        ↓
Coding
        |
        ↓
Commit
        |
        ↓
Push Branch
        |
        ↓
Merge ke Main
```

---

## Membuat Branch Baru

```bash
git checkout -b feature/nama-fitur
```

---

## Commit

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Deskripsi perubahan"
```

---

## Push Branch

```bash
git push origin feature/nama-fitur
```

---

# 14. Recovery Cepat (Shortcut)

Jika project sudah kacau:

```bash
mv hospital-cmms hospital-cmms-backup

git clone -b nama-branch https://github.com/Naverestaroth/hospital-cmms.git hospital-cmms

cd hospital-cmms

cp ../hospital-cmms-backup/.env .env

composer install

npm install

php artisan optimize:clear

npm run dev
```

---

# Catatan

Jika terjadi perbedaan UI antar device, cek dengan urutan:

1. Pastikan folder project benar
2. Pastikan branch benar
3. Pastikan server menjalankan folder tersebut
4. Clear Laravel cache
5. Rebuild Vite
6. Fresh clone jika masih bermasalah

Fresh clone sering lebih cepat daripada memperbaiki project yang sudah tercampur.
